<title>USA: Worldwide Leisure to buy 51 pct of National Health.</title>
<headline>Worldwide Leisure to buy 51 pct of National Health.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Worldwide Leisure Corp said Thursday it has agreed to purchase 51 percent of the common stock of National Health &amp; Safety Corp, of Southampton, Pa.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>&quot;National Health &amp; Safety Corporation is a prominent name in the wellness field,&quot; Worldwide Leisure chief executive George Pappas said in a statement. &quot;They have a Power X (discount) card which can be used in more than 400,000 pharmacies, nursing homes, doctors' and dentists' offices, and clinics, which will be transferred into a Worldwide Leisure Corporation Wellness Card.&quot;</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
